              "perItem": false,
              "source": "[PAUSE 2s]"
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Before the new one: say the Kannada for furniture, then the Kannada for to lean back."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 1,
          "type": "input",
          "title": "You'll want to know: ಸ್ವಿಚ್",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಸ್ವಿಚ್ — svic — \"a switch\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಬಾಗಿಲಿನ ಪಕ್ಕದಲ್ಲಿ ದೀಪದ ಸ್ವಿಚ್ ಇದೆ. bāgilina pakkadalli dīpada svic ide. The light switch is beside the door."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಸ್ವಿಚ್ (svic) ಹಾಕು, to switch on; ಆನ್ ಮಾಡು is also said."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಸ್ವಿಚ್ (svic) is a loan from English switch, written with a final virama as Kannada writes many English loans."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "One more word for describing what you lived and felt."
            }
          ]
        },
