              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಕೊಳವೆ — koḷave — \"a tube; a pipe\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ತೋಟಕ್ಕೆ ನೀರು ಕೊಳವೆಯಲ್ಲಿ ಬರುತ್ತದೆ. tōṭakke nīru koḷaveyalli baruttade. Water comes to the garden through a pipe."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಕೊಳವೆ (koḷave) ಬಾವಿ, a borewell. ಕೊಳಲು, the flute, comes from the same old word for a tube."
            }
          ]
        },
