          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಕೊಳವೆ (koḷave) is native Dravidian: DEDR 1818 lists the Kannada word for \"a tube, a blow-pipe\" in the same article as the word for a flute, ಕೊಳಲು."
            }
          ]
        },
