              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ತಂತಿ — tanti — \"a wire; a string\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಬಟ್ಟೆ ಒಣಗಿಸಲು ಅಮ್ಮ ತಂತಿ ಕಟ್ಟಿದರು. baṭṭe oṇagisalu amma tanti kaṭṭidaru. Mother tied up a wire to dry the clothes."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Also a string of the veena, and in older talk a telegram."
            }
          ]
        },
